WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
09:00 — Save recipe. Mariam saves a recipe on her phone between classes — wanting to cook is easy; remembering which tab is hard.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.000
14:00 — iPad study. iPad study of the same recipe: mise en place notes she will actually follow tonight.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.500
18:00 — Laptop list. Laptop shopping list turns the recipe into ingredients she can buy once, not improvise three times.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:26.000
19:00 — Cook phone. Phone propped while cooking; she finishes the dish instead of abandoning it mid-scroll.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.500
20:30 — Laptop notes. Laptop notes for next time — salt, timing, what to skip. The list was half the cooking.

